{"id":"00286","root":"uni00286_1","name":{"ja":"クラクル","en":"Crackle"},"title":{"ja":"【奔放猫娘】","en":"【Uninhibited Cat Girl】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【奔放猫娘】 クラクル","en":"【Uninhibited Cat Girl】 Crackle"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-01-15","limited":false,"characterId":3,"profile":{"ja":"いつの間にかヨミハラの一角に住み着いていた猫の獣人。奔放だが素直な性格で、高い戦闘能力ゆえに周囲の者達から一目置かれている。彼女にとっては戦いも遊びの一種のようで、対魔忍や米連の人間たちと戦うこともあるが、敵も遊び相手のような感覚でいる。外見こそ人間に近いもののその本質は猫に近く、フラフラと自身のテリトリーを回って食料を得ている。飢えた時には盗みを働いたり、他の生き物を狩ったりすることも厭わない。だが、逆に食料をくれる者にはすぐ懐き、近隣に住む者にはマスコットの様に可愛がられている。好き嫌いせずになんでも食べるが、猫舌なので熱い物は苦手である。基本食べることと遊ぶこと、寝ることしか考えていない。","en":"(Crackle, she/her) She is a cat-folk who somehow took up residence in a corner of Yomihara. She is free-spirited yet honest, and her high combat prowess earns her the respect of those around her. To her, fighting is just another form of play; she battles Taimanin and US soldiers alike, treating opponents as playmates. Though she looks almost human, her essence is feline, and she roams her territory in search of food. When hungry she won't hesitate to steal or hunt other creatures. Conversely, she quickly bonds with anyone who feeds her, and the locals adore her like a mascot. She eats anything without fuss, though her cat tongue makes hot foods uncomfortable. Her life revolves around eating, playing, and sleeping."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"藤井ねここ","forms":[{"id":"uni00286_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1036,2072],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[158,316],"def":[94,188],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","450007"]},{"id":"uni00286_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1572,3144],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[251,502],"def":[123,246],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["1","450007","450008"]},{"id":"uni00286_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2108,4214],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[349,701],"def":[157,317],"spd":[77,77],"lu